@startuml
[*] --> AccountCreation

state AccountCreation
AccountCreation : entry / Collect user details
AccountCreation : do / Validate details
AccountCreation : exit / Account created or error

AccountCreation --> Login : [Details Valid]
AccountCreation --> [*] : [Details Invalid]

state Login
Login : entry / Get login credentials
Login : do / Verify credentials
Login : exit / Logged in or incorrect credentials

Login --> VisaApplication : [Credentials Valid]
Login --> [*] : [Credentials Invalid]

state VisaApplication
VisaApplication : entry / Initiate visa application
VisaApplication : do / Collect application details and payment
VisaApplication : exit / Application submitted

VisaApplication --> StatusView : [Payment successful]
VisaApplication --> [*] : [Payment failed]

state StatusView
StatusView : entry / View application status
StatusView : do / Display status information
StatusView : exit / Status viewed

StatusView --> StatusCheck : [Status viewed]
StatusView --> [*] : [Error]

state StatusCheck
StatusCheck : entry / Check application status
StatusCheck : do / Display status information
StatusCheck : exit / Status checked

StatusCheck --> Feedback : [Status checked]
StatusCheck --> [*] : [Error]

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback
Feedback : do / Record feedback
Feedback : exit / Feedback submitted

Feedback --> Logout : [Feedback submitted]
Feedback --> [*] : [Error]

state CancelApplication
CancelApplication : entry / Initiate cancellation
CancelApplication : do / Process cancellation request
CancelApplication : exit / Application cancelled

CancelApplication --> Login : [Cancellation successful]
CancelApplication --> [*] : [Cancellation failed]

state ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails : entry / Modify user details
ModifyDetails : do / Update user details
ModifyDetails : exit / Details modified

ModifyDetails --> Login : [Details modified]
ModifyDetails --> [*] : [Error]

state ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / View user details
ViewDetails : do / Display user details
ViewDetails : exit / Details viewed

ViewDetails --> Login : [Details viewed]
ViewDetails --> [*] : [Error]

state ViewPurpose
ViewPurpose : entry / View application purpose
ViewPurpose : do / Display application purpose
ViewPurpose : exit / Purpose viewed

ViewPurpose --> Login : [Purpose viewed]
ViewPurpose --> [*] : [Error]

state Logout
Logout : entry / Initiate logout
Logout : do / End session
Logout : exit / Logged out

Logout --> [*]

@enduml
